# DO_SET_ROI: setROIToolStripMenuItem_Click (GCSViews/FlightPlanner.cs:6673). Appends a DO_SET_ROI
# (201) at the click, at Default Alt (TXT_DefaultAlt, 100). The ROI carries a position, as
# Mavlink.cs's [hasLocation] says, so it is scaled as one on the wire.

env MP_CONFIG_XML $WORK/config.xml
screen plan
window 1600x1200
budget 3

# The map first: a press before its first paint records nothing.
expect map.ready true
click map@0.45x0.40
click map@0.30x0.70:right
click menu-setROI
expect mission.items 2
expect mission.commands 16,201
expect mission.last.position true
expect mission.last.alt 100
